//! ASM1 CSTR / network parity against the TypeScript oracle.
//!
//! Golden values were generated by `src/sim/asm1Network.ts` on 2026-11-25:
//! CSTR 24 h (V=1000 m3, Q=100 m3/h, 1 h steps, 20 °C) and a five-tank
//! 48 h slice (feed 1546 m3/h, RAS 454 m3/h, 0.5 h steps, x_RAS=4500 mg/L).
//! The slice is intentionally separate from the plant engine; it locks
//! advection + reaction + RAS thickening before settler/ADM1 parity is added.

